OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and bright across southern
OL,6,Fareas today, with cloudier skies
OL,7,Ffurther north and a few showers. More
OL,8,Fpersistent rain will reach Cumbria by
OL,9,Flate afternoon. Temperatures around
OL,10,Faverage but feeling pleasant in any
OL,11,Fsunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying largely dry this
OL,14,Fevening across the south, but
OL,15,Foutbreaks of rain continuing
OL,16,Felsewhere. Rain then becoming
OL,17,Fincreasingly heavy and more widespread
OL,18,Ftowards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
