OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA rather cloudy, breezy and
OL,6,Fwet day, with the rain heaviest and
OL,7,Fmost persistent towards the north.
OL,8,FTemperatures near average, but rather
OL,9,Fcool in the more prolonged spells of
OL,10,Frain.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDrier
OL,13,Fand brighter on Thursday before
OL,14,Ffurther rain arrives overnight. Rain
OL,15,Fclearing early Friday to a mix of
OL,16,Fsunshine and showers. Largely fine on
OL,17,FSaturday with some warm sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
